        <mxCell id="YXx9BxjXFM60DNCwBHbt-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;EQUIPO-REDES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Punt central d&#39;interconnexió de la xarxa corporativa de la emrpesa, que gestiona el trànsit d&#39;Internet, la connectivitat entre seus i la seguretat perimetral.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;T286Pc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cb=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; class=&quot;Yjhzub&quot;&gt;MI-RED&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt; és la xarxa perimetral o zona de publicació a Internet. És el segment on arriben els usuaris que es connecten des de fora, passant pels Tallafocs (Firewalls) i servidors de seguretat (WAAP) abans d&#39;accedir als portals web oficials o serveis públics&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
